---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Dodo & Co. | Pediatric Sleep Consulting in San Diego" description="Gentle, personalized baby sleep consulting with Alexa Gisch, RN, MSN. Independent sleep for babies under 12 months. San Diego and virtual." current="home">

  <div class="hero"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">Pediatric sleep consulting · San Diego &amp; virtual</span>
      <h1>Helping little dreamers sleep, so the whole family can <em>rest</em>.</h1>
      <p class="lede">I'm Alexa, a labor and delivery nurse, certified sleep consultant and mama. I help families teach their babies to sleep independently, with a plan built around their baby's unique temperament.</p>
      <div class="ctas"><a class="btn primary" href="/get-started">Book your free intro call</a><a class="btn ghost" href="/sleep-support">How it works</a></div>
      <div class="cred-line"><span>Registered nurse, MSN</span><span>IPSP certified sleep consultant</span><span>Babies under 12 months</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="arch"><div class="frame"><img src="/img/alexa-cuddle.jpg" alt="Alexa cuddling her baby at the beach"></div><span class="star" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="badge"><img src="/img/logo.jpg" alt="Dodo &amp; Co. logo"></div></div>
  </div></div>

  <section style="padding-top:20px"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="dict">
      <span class="word">faire dodo</span>
      <span class="pron"><b>French</b>/fɛʁ do.do/ · to go night-night</span>
      <p>It's what French parents say at bedtime, and it's where our name comes from. Bienvenue chez Dodo &amp; Co.</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section><div class="wrap split rev">
    <div class="txt">
      <span class="eyebrow">Sound familiar?</span>
      <h2>You're doing everything, and your baby is still fighting sleep.</h2>
      <p>Rocking, nursing or a bottle to sleep, contact naps, the pacifier on repeat, naps only in the car. You're exhausted, and some days you feel like you're losing yourself a little.</p>
      <div class="chips"><span>Contact naps</span><span>Rocking to sleep</span><span>Feeding to sleep</span><span>Pacifier resets</span><span>Naps on the go</span><span>Up every 2 hours</span></div>
      <p>I've been there. Postpartum can feel dark and isolating, and better sleep is what helped me feel like me again. Your baby is smarter than you think. With a plan and some consistency, babies learn sleep as a skill, just like eating or walking.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="photo" style="aspect-ratio:4/5"><img src="/img/alexa-hug.jpg" alt="Alexa holding her child close by the ocean" loading="lazy"></div>
  </div></section>

  <section style="padding-top:10px"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><span class="eyebrow">How I help</span><h2>Structured, but never one-size-fits-all.</h2></div>
    <div class="pillars">
      <div class="pillar"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 14.5A8 8 0 1 1 9.5 4a6.5 6.5 0 0 0 10.5 10.5z"/></svg></span><h3>Built around your baby</h3><p>Every baby has their own temperament. Your plan and daily schedule are made for your baby and your family's life.</p></div>
      <div class="pillar"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 21s-7-4.4-7-10a4 4 0 0 1 7-2.6A4 4 0 0 1 19 11c0 5.6-7 10-7 10z"/></svg></span><h3>A gentle check-in method</h3><p>You stay involved and can go in to reassure your baby. Each parent gets a role, so you feel in control the whole way.</p></div>
      <div class="pillar"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 12a8 8 0 0 1-11.6 7.1L4 20l1-4.6A8 8 0 1 1 21 12z"/></svg></span><h3>Right there with you</h3><p>Check-ins by text, phone and FaceTime while you work through the plan, until you feel you're in a good spot.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <div class="sky"><img src="/img/sky.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"><blockquote>“Good sleep isn't selfish. It's how your baby grows, and how you start feeling like you again.”<cite>Alexa Gisch, RN</cite></blockquote></div>

  <section><div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><span class="eyebrow">How it works</span><h2>From first hello to sleeping through.</h2></div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><span class="n">1</span><h3>Tell me about your family</h3><p>Fill out a short intake form about your baby's age, current sleep and your goals.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><span class="n">2</span><h3>Free intro call</h3><p>A relaxed 15 to 30 minute chat about your baby's sleep and how I work. No pressure.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><span class="n">3</span><h3>Your custom plan</h3><p>A written sleep plan and daily schedule built around your baby's temperament.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><span class="n">4</span><h3>Support as you go</h3><p>Text, phone and FaceTime check-ins. We adjust together based on how it's going.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="after"><b>And after?</b><span>For nap drops and schedule changes down the road, I'm just a text or a phone call away.</span></div>
  </div></section>

  <section style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
    <figure class="review" style="margin:0"><span class="q" aria-hidden="true">“</span><div>
      <p>I am also a nurse, so I just don't want to be told what to do. I want to understand the why. Alexa was incredibly knowledgeable, methodical, patient, and thorough. She was able to explain the science and physiology behind infant sleep in a way that made everything make sense, while also giving us practical guidance that we could actually implement.</p>
      <footer>Natalie, nurse and Dodo &amp; Co. mama</footer></div></figure>
    <div class="snips" style="margin-top:20px">
      <blockquote><p>“Within 24–48 hours, we were seeing a huge difference in our baby's sleep.”</p><cite>Natalie</cite></blockquote>
      <blockquote><p>“We are now all getting amazing, sound sleep every night, and I honestly never thought I would be able to say that.”</p><cite>Natalie</cite></blockquote>
      <blockquote><p>“One of my best friends sleep trained her daughter shortly after I finished with Alexa. She is now sleeping through the night as well!”</p><cite>Natalie</cite></blockquote>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta"><div><h2>Ready for more rest?</h2><p>Tell me a little about your family and we'll set up your free intro call.</p></div><div class="ctas"><a class="btn primary" href="/get-started">Get started</a></div></div>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
